    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Is it possible to provide `rg` with arguments on demand as https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-live-grep-args.nvim allows?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is it possible to provide <code class=\"notranslate\">rg</code> with arguments on demand as <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-live-grep-args.nvim\">https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-live-grep-args.nvim</a> allows?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Is it possible to provide rg with arguments on demand as https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-live-grep-args.nvim allows?",
